WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:06.180
Speaker 1: A White House press secretary,
Jen Psaki, has tested positive for COVID and

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.919
of course, the question was.

00:00:07.919 --> 00:00:12.730
Well, when was she with Joe Biden and what's
going on, and it actually turns out that she

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:16.670
hasn't been around Joe Biden for a little
bit and is not on Joe Biden's current trip

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.090
to Europe, apparently because many in her
family had tested positive.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:22.439
So here's the report from CNN.

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:26.460
Psaki tests positive for COVID last saw Biden
Tuesday.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:31.609
White House Press Secretary Jen Psaki, who
dropped off President Joe Biden's international

00:00:31.609 --> 00:00:37.190
trip shortly before he departed, has tested
positive for coronavirus after members of

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:39.090
her household did.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:45.039
Psaki said she last saw Biden Tuesday outside
while masked before the president departed

00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:51.430
for Rome for the Group of 20 summit, and that
she tested negative several times in between.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:57.340
Psaki said she was disclosing the positive
test result quote out of an abundance of transparency,

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:01.050
adding she experienced mild symptoms and is
working remotely.

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:05.450
It's unlikely Psaki could have infected Biden
with COVID 19.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:08.430
Several physicians told CNN Sunday.

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:13.180
Based on the timeline of MBS Psaki's testing
negative for multiple days following her last

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:17.860
encounter with Biden, which was also outside
and masked, therefore very low risk in and

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:18.860
of itself.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:23.870
Dr. Leana Wen, a CNN medical analyst and former
Baltimore city health commissioner, said in

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:24.870
an email.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:28.790
The White House announced Thursday Psaki would
no longer join Biden on his trip abroad for

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.800
the at least the first few days, citing a
family emergency.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.570
White House Deputy Press Secretary Karine
Jean-Pierre instead traveled with the president.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:43.620
Jen Psaki put out a statement about this,
where she said on Wednesday, in coordination

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:48.230
with senior leadership at the White House
and the medical team, I made the decision

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:53.470
not to travel with the four on the foreign
trip with the president due to a family emergency,

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:57.650
which was members of my household testing
positive for COVID 19.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:02.350
Since then, I have quarantined and tested
negative via PCR for COVID on Wednesday, Thursday,

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.350
Friday and Saturday.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.700
However, today I tested positive for COVID.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:10.310
While I have not had close contact in person
with the president or senior members of the

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:15.070
White House staff since Wednesday and tested
negative for four days after that last contact.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:18.340
I am disclosing today's positive test out
of an abundance of transparency.

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:23.540
I last saw the president on Tuesday when we
sat outside more than six feet apart and wore

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:24.820
masks.

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:29.740
Thanks to the vaccine, I have only experienced
mild symptoms, which has enabled me to continue

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:30.780
working from home.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:35.090
I plan to return to work in person at the
conclusion of the 10 day quarantine following

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:40.610
a negative rapid test, which is an additional
White House requirement beyond CDC guidance.

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:46.300
Taken out of an abundance of caution, so she's
vaccinated.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:50.310
So is Joe Biden outside masks to vaccinated
people?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.480
Transmission risk is almost zero.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.480
I say I don't say zero because strange things
happen when you have bell curve distribution

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:02.230
of things and unexplainable things happen
incredibly unlikely that Joe Biden would get

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.230
COVID.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:10.200
In this case, she correctly assesses her risk
is lower and her risk of a serious case is

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.640
lower because she's vaccinated.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.640
That's true.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.840
Now there are people, opportunists and just
ignorant people who will see this.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.330
And once again, much like with the death of
Colin Powell, say this is proof that the vaccines

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.550
don't work.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:28.940
And of course, any one anecdote doesn't tell
us much about at a population level what does

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:31.240
and doesn't work about vaccines.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:37.670
The fact that Colin Powell died despite being
vaccinated, given that he was 84 and immunocompromised

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:41.810
in more than one way, doesn't really tell
us anything about the effect that a population

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:46.790
level of vaccination and much the same way
when Jen Psaki says thanks to the vaccine,

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.830
I have mild symptoms.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.820
That's not really an empirical statement.

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:55.630
Statistically speaking, she's likely to have
fewer symptoms thanks to being vaccinated

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.680
any individual, though.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:03.090
It's harder to make such a statement, but
her general assessment is correct by being

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.849
vaccinated.

00:04:04.849 --> 00:04:09.480
She's at lower risk for a serious case, and
unfortunately there are many people who either

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:13.370
don't understand the science or don't want
to understand it because they have preconceived

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:18.851
notions or desires about what they believe
the vaccine to do, where they will say, What's

00:04:18.851 --> 00:04:20.390
the point of getting vaccinated?

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.130
Psaki was vaccinated and she got it well.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.780
She's she's working at home and she seems
to feel mostly OK.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.419
So that's the latest.

00:04:27.419 --> 00:04:35.500
Very unlikely that Joe Biden could have received
the virus or been what's the word that she

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:40.960
would have spread the virus to Joe Biden in
the situation that was described, particularly

00:04:40.960 --> 00:05:13.510
when she continued testing negative 

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:26.880
for 

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:46.190
several days?

